webapp/static_public/data/map_overlays/README.txt -text
webapp/static_public/data/map_overlays/military_base_overlay_membership_overrides.json -text
webapp/static_public/data/map_overlays/military_base_temporal_overrides.json -text
webapp/static_public/data/map_overlays/overlay_sources.json -text
